<div class="cff-post-text" >
	<span class="cff-text" data-color="">
		𝗙𝗿𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗲 𝗲𝘅𝘁𝗲𝗻𝗱𝘀 𝗮𝘀𝘀𝗶𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗲 𝘁𝗼 𝗵𝗲𝗹𝗽 𝗹𝗼𝘄-𝗶𝗻𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗲 𝗳𝗮𝗺𝗶𝗹𝗶𝗲𝘀 𝗮𝗰𝗰𝗲𝘀𝘀 𝗻𝘂𝘁𝗿𝗶𝘁𝗶𝗼𝘂𝘀 𝗳𝗼𝗼𝗱<img class="cff-linebreak" /><img class="cff-linebreak" />The Department of Finance (DOF) partnered with the French development agency, Agence Française de Développement (AFD), to help low income families access nutritious food.<img class="cff-linebreak" /><img class="cff-linebreak" />Finance Secretary Frederick D. Go led the signing of the financing agreement, thanking AFD for its continued partnership and confidence in the Philippines as the country advances its development priorities.<img class="cff-linebreak" /><img class="cff-linebreak" />Through the REFUEL Project, around 750,000 households will receive monthly electronic food vouchers redeemable at accredited retailers, backed by EUR 200 million in AFD financing and co-financing from the Asian Development Bank (ADB).<img class="cff-linebreak" /><img class="cff-linebreak" />Read more: <a href="https://www.dof.gov.ph/france-extends-assistance-to-help-low-income-families-access-nutritious-food/" rel='nofollow noopener noreferrer'>www.dof.gov.ph/france-extends-assistance-to-help-low-income-families-access-nutritious-food/</a><img class="cff-linebreak" /><img class="cff-linebreak" /><a href="https://facebook.com/1589699367813804">#DOFUpdates</a>			</span>
	<span class="cff-expand">&#8230; <a href="#" style="color: #"><span class="cff-more">See More</span><span class="cff-less">See Less</span></a></span>

</div>

